# REN — Git attributes
#
# Git LFS, FORWARD-ONLY (adopted 2026-09-30, sprint Day 1).
# - New or modified Unreal binaries are stored in LFS from now on.
# - Binaries committed before this file (bootstrap commit 2a5f81e) stay as
#   normal Git blobs. History is NOT rewritten; do NOT run
#   `git lfs migrate` or `git add --renormalize .` without explicit approval.
# - Every local machine must run once:  git lfs install
#   (without it, Git silently commits raw binaries instead of LFS pointers).

*.uasset filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.umap   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Text files: normalize line endings; keep Windows-authored configs readable.
*.py     text eol=lf
*.md     text
*.json   text
*.ini    text
*.uproject text
